{"input": "плакат с надписью С новым годом 2:3", "outputs": ["A vertical New Year poster with the words \"С новым годом\" in large hand-painted gold Cyrillic letters across the top third. Below, a snowy pine forest at dusk with warm lights in a small wooden house, falling snow, and a deep blue sky with a few bright stars."], "nsfw_result": "safe", "aspect_ratio": "2:3"}
</example>

<example>
