{"input": "a red vintage bicycle leaning against a white brick wall in morning sunlight, shallow depth of field, 35mm film look", "outputs": ["A red vintage bicycle leans against a white brick wall in low morning sunlight, long soft shadows across the bricks. 35mm film photograph with shallow depth of field, warm highlights, gentle grain."], "nsfw_result": "safe", "aspect_ratio": "3:2"}
</example>

