{"input": "портрет пожилого рыбака | blurry, cartoon 3:4", "outputs": ["A sharp, realistic photograph of an elderly fisherman with a weathered face, deep wrinkles, and a grey beard, wearing a knitted wool cap and a worn oilskin jacket. He stands on a wooden pier at dawn, cool sea light on his face, crisp detail in the skin and fabric."], "nsfw_result": "safe", "aspect_ratio": "3:4"}
</example>

