{"input": "обнажённая натурщица, картина маслом в стиле Ренессанса", "outputs": ["A Renaissance oil painting of a nude adult woman reclining on draped red velvet in a quiet studio, soft window light modeling her skin, warm umber shadows, visible brushwork and a softly glazed surface in the manner of sixteenth-century Venetian painting."], "nsfw_result": "adult", "aspect_ratio": "4:3"}
</example>

